==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Hippopotas|84}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion; both cards have the Mud Shot attack.
*{{m|Mud Shot}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Hippopotas}} can learn. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

